@startuml oo-analysis-design-steps
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #2e86c1
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #eaf2f8
skinparam ActivityFontColor #1a5276
skinparam ArrowColor #1a5276
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #f9e79f
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #f39c12

title OO Analysis and Design Process

start

:=== Step 1: OO Analysis ===
- Identify objects
- Describe responsibilities
- Define collaborations;

:=== Step 2: OO Design ===
- Meet requirements
- Join objects via associations
- Refine relationships;

:=== Step 3: OO Implementation ===
- Implement design in OO language
  (Java, C++, C#, etc.)
- Build and test;

stop

@enduml
